<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others had invited me out; I turned them down, and lay face down on the bed in my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My face buried in the pillow, I pushed the unpleasant air in and out of my lungs through my mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't really know how long I had kept this position.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was nearly the hour when the orange evening sun dyes the room.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others, what were they doing now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They must surely be making the most of the Cherry Blossom Festival at Chuo Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I was grateful they went to the trouble of inviting me, but―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">for me, going to the Cherry Blossom Festival is suicide.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I let out a big sigh, the lukewarm breath came back onto my face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I want to deny the way everyone admires the cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I know it's just me who is strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">April has only just begun, and there must be plenty of people bubbling over about their new lives.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">People who sink into a gloomy mood at this time of year are probably in the minority.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, maybe there are plenty of people who turn gloomy at this time of year too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There must be plenty of people whose living environment has changed and who find that stressful.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But in my case, it's different from that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The cherry blossoms―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When the season comes for the cherry blossoms to bloom, I―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the open window, along with the breeze, came the din outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No sound in particular caught my attention.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now and then a child's voice, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of a car, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of the wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The intercom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Getting up was too much trouble―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought about pretending not to be home, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But in this season, at this hour, I can pretty much guess who it is.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">All right, all right, I'm opening it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I opened the door, a high-school girl with short hair was standing there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought: </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey! How're you doing?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">so-so, I guess."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To that cheerful greeting, unchanged as ever, I answered with a bit of a forced smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The corners of my mouth wouldn't go up properly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm...
{PAUSE ""}
so the April sickness isn't any better this year either, huh." [TN: coined against the real Japanese term for a slump after a new start, the May blues.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> kept her smile, but twisted her mouth a little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, it happens every year, so I'm used to it by now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see...
{PAUSE ""}
Over on our side, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE> ate her way through one stall after another and it was rough."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even as she said it was rough, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> spoke happily.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is small and still a big eater, isn't she? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Where does all that food go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">At last I managed to answer with a natural smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, my own stomach's been off since yesterday, so I kept it to nibbling.
{PAUSE ""}
So, here. A souvenir!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I was handed a plastic bag, neither large nor small.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the feel of it in my hand, it was quite heavy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"It's takoyaki, so eat it while it's hot.
{PAUSE ""}
See ya!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "500" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\靴足音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Not long after the door closed, the sound of the next apartment's door opening and closing spread dully along the outside walkway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> went home oddly quickly, but it was probably because she was worried about the strain on my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> take all this trouble over me has become the routine work of this time of year, every year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> doesn't mind, I know that, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">but, I still feel bad about it...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I let out another big sigh, picked up the plastic bag and went back to my room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\自室背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\small_window_C.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "SE2" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It had gotten a little cold, so I closed the window.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then the outside </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="けんそう">din</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> vanished, and the room was wrapped in a brief silence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But within a few seconds my ears adjusted, and the sounds outside began to touch my eardrums faintly again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I put the takoyaki on the desk and burrowed into the bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sure enough, my </STYLE>best friend<STYLE ID="1"> knows me well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Last year, and the year before that, she came by the same way, didn't she?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But it's the first time she has brought a gift along for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She's always looking after me, and I've never really done anything you could call thanks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The day before yesterday </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to have an upset stomach, so next time </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> isn't well, I'll take a gift along and go and see her.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> calls this gloomy mood of mine April sickness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this season when the cherry blossoms bloom, just like the May blues, I sink into a gloom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't really know the reason, but apparently my constitution just won't accept cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, for me, early April is nothing but days of pain.</STYLE>
